==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|inimitable}}, from {{der|en|la|inimitabilis}}, corresponding to {{affix|en|in-|imitable}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈɪmɪtəbl̩/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Beyond [[imitation]], [[surpassing]] all others, [[matchless]].
#: {{ant|en|imitable|commonplace}}

====Usage notes====
Not to be confused with {{m|en|inimicable|t=harmful, hostile}}.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|inimitability}}
* {{l|en|inimitably}}

